    lines += ['Find Potion has5004 bounded compiled source cases in [source evidence](../tools/reference/find-potion-engine-evidence.json), including all15 output-code rows and linked Udead/noselect repeat-attempt exclusion. Its native caster Act/game-difficulty context question remains open; no handler or arbitrary tier is enabled. War Cry now reuses the ring/stun/damage systems with saved physical endpoints and distinct block/motion/delay rules; bounded source and native evidence is in `tools/reference/warcry-engine-evidence.json` and `tools/reference/warcry-native-evidence.json`. Its remaining acceptance gaps do not block other Barbarian skills. Find Item now uses captured ordinary corpse treasure context, saved one-attempt state and the existing native loot factories; special contexts remain explicitly unsupported.','']
